(7629646, 1236334, 153275, '<td valign="top">This is surrealistic. The longer I look at this picture, the more I like it. The way it is symmetric and non-symmetric at the same time, both horizontally and vertically. The way the space is divided in 4 horizontal areas (building/sky/glass/reflection). The way horizontal becomes vertical and vice versa. The world upside down. And the bird doesn''t care about this all... he just flies from A to B. Because that is what birds do.</td>', 'This is surrealistic. The longer I look at this picture, the more I like it. The way it is symmetric and non-symmetric at the same time, both horizontally and vertically. The way the space is divided in 4 horizontal areas (building/sky/glass/reflection). The way horizontal becomes vertical and vice versa. The world upside down. And the bird doesn''t care about this all... he just flies from A to B. Because that is what birds do.', '2019-05-15 17:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7629647, 1236662, 153275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrasts</td>', 'Beautiful contrasts', '2019-05-15 17:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
